abstract: >-
  Written proof of the sharp additive constant 1 on the unchanged integer
  full-slack domain, with exact computational evidence. The downstream
  M <= 49 consequence retains inherited assumptions, and the complete
  sufficient dimension threshold remains 600. Substantial OpenAI Codex
  assistance; no formal verification or human peer review is claimed.
